{'symbol': 'CZR', 'date': '2021-04-21 14:00:00', 'title': 'CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT TO INVEST $400 MILLION INTO ITS ATLANTIC CITY RESORTS BY 2023', 'text': 'ATLANTIC CITY, N.J., APRIL 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT, INC. ("CAESARS" OR THE "COMPANY") SHARED EXCITING DETAILS TODAY ON ITS $400 MILLION MASTER PLAN INVESTMENT IN ATLANTIC CITY WHERE IT OWNS AND OPERATES THREE OF THE REGION\'S PREEMINENT CASINO DESTINATIONS – CAESARS, HARRAH\'S RESORT AND TROPICANA ATLANTIC CITY.'}